  "material_checks": [
    "Native framing end can overwrite Failed with Ended and accepts repeated clean end.",
    "CBOR tag recursion does not advance depth; native TCP driver does not call this binary codec.",
    "Native event pump raw string search can terminate on an ordinary event's session_end-valued field; driver emits Ended on pump closure.",
    "Actual native AgentMessage/AssistantMessage serde call chain emits tooluse while TS expects toolUse; as_str does not alter serde.",
    "TS server Unix close marks closing before waiting the tail, so queued-but-not-entered writes reject; in-flight writes differ.",
    "TS output guard immediately exits on asynchronous nonretryable sink failure; cooperative adapter shutdown is a different boundary.",
    "TS message pagination hashes identity/count metadata, not message content.",
    "TS no-assistant-text host omits undefined text while its client requires text:string|null.",
    "Request cancellation preserves the target's active record and clears it only through finish; queued cancellation does not remove ordering latches."
  ],
